      "payload": {
        "progress": "Mapped the failure and test surfaces: tree/review/stale/questions have uncaught non-abortable fetches, router has no errorElement, tree eagerly expands all nodes with cumulative indentation, mobile nav icon links lose names below sm, and CI has no DOM/browser gate. Chosen design: shared timeout+abort query hook, explicit retry state, persisted depth-1 tree expansion, separate jsdom Vitest config, and Chromium Playwright smoke against the committed web fixture."
      },
      "at": "2026-08-02T11:40:04.831Z"
