      "payload": {
        "progress": "Implemented shared abort+timeout query lifecycle and retry states for config/tree/review/questions/stale; added a route error boundary; rebuilt the tree around persisted accessible branch controls with root-only default expansion and mobile wrapping; fixed compact nav names/layout; and added jsdom plus Chromium desktop/mobile gates in CI/release. Verified typecheck, lint, format, component tests (4), Playwright flows (3), build, and full suite (1,965 tests); inspected nonblank desktop/mobile captures with no horizontal overflow."
      },
